[[Selmie]] uses the cabin to wait out the blizzard over [[Hebra Mountains]] with her [[Shield Surfing]]-pupils, [[Russ]] and [[Fin]]. It is decorated with a variety of different shields. If [[Link]] tries to interact with any of them, she scolds him for it.<ref>{{Cite|H-hey! What are you doing?! You don't mess with another surfer's shield.|Selmie|TotK}}</ref> 

